  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Safeguarding the digital ecosystem",
    "splashDescription": "Meet rising cyber resilience expectations by orchestrating cyber governance and incident response processes end-to-end, including board-level accountability requirements from regulations such as the Digital Operational Resilience Act (DORA) and the UK Cyber Security and Resilience Bill. This blueprint helps you move from prevention-only to operational resilience by coordinating decision points, human approvals, and automated actions to maintain continuity under disruption. Gain unified visibility across suppliers, partners, and service providers, trigger timely responses based on disruption signals, and keep a clear audit trail to support assurance reporting and reduce reputational and operational impact.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/773510/overview/img3607764769915555324.png?8f3a603a84c25d2019e4301949ed821c",
